berth, A CLI to help add you dev environment into a devcontainer without touching repository code

Usage: berth [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  init   
  up     
  build  
  view   
  help   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --config-path <FILE>  
      --cleanup             
  -h, --help                Print help
